OL,3,GNEWSACalls grow to protect key ancient
OL,4,Awoodland
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupport for a campaign to expand the
OL,7,FKent Downs National Landscape to
OL,8,Finclude one of the country's most
OL,9,Fimportant woodland habitats is gaining
OL,10,Fmomentum.
OL,12,FThe Blean Woods, near Canterbury,
OL,13,Fcomprise several areas of ancient
OL,14,Fwoodland and are regarded as a
OL,15,Fsignificant refuge for wildlife.
OL,17,FAlthough they lie close to the boundary
OL,18,Fof the Kent Downs National Landscape,
OL,19,Fthey are not currently included within
OL,20,Fthe protected area, according to the
OL,21,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
